# FiberLog environment defaults.
#
# Vite inlines anything prefixed VITE_ into the build at compile time. The
# anon key is meant to be public (RLS in the DB is the access boundary), so
# it's safe to commit this file once the repo has git.
#
# To override locally (e.g. point at a dev Supabase project), copy this to
# .env.local and edit there. .env.local is gitignored and overrides .env.

